OL,3,GNEWSA'Giant rats plague flat' and
OL,4,A'teens cause firework chaos'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FA woman from Hartcliffe told Bristol
OL,11,FLive she has been left living "in
OL,12,Fabsolute hell" with giant rats climbing
OL,13,Fup the walls outside her flat and drunk
OL,14,Fstrangers banging on the door asking to
OL,15,Fbuy drugs. Bristol City Council bosses
OL,16,Fhave now promised to take action.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
