OL,3,GNEWSA'Giant rats plague flat' and
OL,4,A'teens cause firework chaos'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old Bridgwater woman died a
OL,7,Fday after telling psychiatric staff she
OL,8,Fwould kill herself if discharged,
OL,9,Faccording to Chard and Ilminster News.
OL,10,FAn inquest into the death of Abbie Winn
OL,11,Fheard that she had "struggled with her
OL,12,Fmental health after her mother's death
OL,13,Fa few years ago".
OL,15,FThe Wiltshire Times reported that plans
OL,16,Ffor 200 new homes have sparked "a wave
OL,17,Fof opposition" over fears the
OL,18,Fdevelopment could threaten rare
OL,19,Fhorseshoe bats and their habitat.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
